===Basement===
The basement is only accessible from the Department Store via the elevator.

A team of workers and a {{p|Machoke}} are moving boxes around. The player gets told off by the workers for going down and distracting them. This is one of the endpoints of the [[Goldenrod Tunnel]], although the door leading to the tunnel won't open until the player enters the Department Store through the tunnel.

In [[Generation II]], every time the player enters the area, the boxes will be moved in various places, allowing access to items that are on the ground in blocked rooms. In {{2v2|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}, talking to the workers will cause each Machoke to move a box, allowing access to each blocked room and the items inside them, with no need to leave and reenter the area.

