==In animation==
[[File:Goldenrod Galleria.png|thumb|250px|Goldenrod Galleria in {{aniseries|GS}}]]
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|GS}}====
The Goldenrod Department Store, known as Goldenrod Galleria in the English [[dub]] and also known as "Department Store" ('''デパート''' ''Depāto'') in Japanese, appeared in ''[[EP158|A Goldenrod Opportunity]]'', where {{Ash}} and {{ashfr}} decided to visit it and were eventually led there by [[Whitney]], leading to {{an|Misty}} and her doing some shopping. Meanwhile, {{TRT}} ate some free samples to satisfy their hunger, but ended up eating non-free food as well. They were forced to work to pay for the food they had eaten, but they ended up running away when they spotted Whitney's {{p|Clefairy}} and decided to steal it.

===={{aniseries|DP}}====
In ''[[DP143|An Egg Scramble!]]'', the Goldenrod Galleria made a cameo appearance during {{an|Lyra}}'s presentation of the Johto region during the [[Johto Festival]].
